[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> # Calculate Average Deflator Growth (Recent 4 years: 2021-2024)
[?2004l[?2004h> # Rows 3, 4, 5, 6. Average of D3:D6? No, D column is growth.
